docs {
  # VULN-05 Remediation Verification
  
  ## Objective:
  Verify that query filter parameters are strictly validated against an allow-list of strings and type-checked, preventing nested objects and NoSQL operators from reaching MongoDB.
  
  ## Expected Result:
  The injected operator object is ignored or rejected, returning standard unfiltered/validated results safely without executing `$ne`.
  
  Capture a screenshot for your AFTER evidence!
}
